<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 558 0 R
/E (Think of daily mobility sessions the way you think of brushing your teeth. No single session produces a dramatic change, but the cumulative effect over weeks and months is substantial. These sessions maintain joint range of motion, sustain connective-tissue hydration, and signal to the nervous system that movement is safe and expected. That last point matters: a body that moves daily tolerates further movement better than one that is sedentary all week andthen trained hard on weekends. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
