<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 563 0 R
/T (3. Chest Opening \(3 minutes\): Place a rolled towel or thin pillow lengthwise along your spine and allow your arms to fall open to the sides. Breathe into your chest. This passively stretches the anterior chest wall and is particularly effective after a day of forward-leaning posture. )
/E (3. Chest Opening \(3 minutes\): Place a rolled towel or thin pillow lengthwise along your spine and allow your arms to fall open to the sides. Breathe into your chest. This passively stretches the anterior chest wall and is particularly effective after a day of forward-leaning posture. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
