/Title (1. Grounding and Body Scan \(3 minutes\): Lie on your back with knees bent and supported. Notice the points of contact between your body and the surface beneath you. Slowly direct attention from your feet upwards, consciously releasing any held tension in each region. This is a form of progressive relaxation, a technique with strong evidence for reducing sleep onset latency.)
